<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00</p>
<p>higher than Tuesdays close. Demand good for a light to moderate</p>
<p>run. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  57.50-58.50, few 59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  56.00-57.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 higher. Top 50.00</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 43.00-45.50</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 46.00-48.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs. 48.00-49.00, few 50.00</p>
</text>
